  "prefLabel": "Puc 404.01 Tariff for Wholesale Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 404.01 Tariff for Wholesale Services.\n\n(a) Telephone utilities that offer wholesale services to other carriers shall maintain a complete tariff of such services with the commission pursuant to Puc 1600 for:\n\n(1) Services required by 47 U.S.C. § 251 (c);\n\n(2) Services referred to as tariffed in interconnection agreements filed pursuant to 47 U.S.C. § 252; and\n\n(3) Intrastate access service.\n\n(b) When a telephone utility's intrastate access tariff is the same as its interstate access tariff the interstate tariff may be filed pursuant to Puc 1600 as the intrastate tariff.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Puc 400) #14029, eff 7-25-24 (formerly Puc 404.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc400.html"
